WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:07.009
My name is Rossteen Salehzadeh and I'm from
Ann Arbor Michigan. I graduated from Washtenaw

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:14.669
Christian Academy in 2010, and I'm a Politics
major at Hillsdale College. This spring I'm

00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:19.740
interning in United States Senator Deb Fischer's
office as part of the Washington Hillsdale

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.630
Internship Program. The Washington Hillsdale
Internship Program, we

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:29.550
call it WHIP for short, we bring anywhere between ten
to twenty students a semester out to DC. They

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:33.370
take two or three classes and they intern
on the hill, at the Heritage

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:38.160
Foundation, really anywhere they want to.
When we find somebody coming out of college

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:43.520
who has some practical real world experience,
especially experience that applies to what

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:48.950
we do, it really sets them apart. Washington
is one of those places that kids can learn

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:54.410
a lot and gain a lot just from being hear
a few moths. And in that since, coming here

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:58.300
and having that interning experience I guarantee
will be life changing.

